{138}{I don't interact with the townspeople often. There's a kid, Joe I think, who talks to me sometimes, asking questions and following me around. There's a gypsy who has some interesting magickal items, a blacksmith - he doesn't like me, and a general shop clerk. The general store's connected to the bar, and it's always noisy and crowded in there.}{I don't interact with the townspeople often. There's a kid, Joe I think, who talks to me sometimes, asking questions and following me around. There's a gypsy who has some interesting magickal items, a blacksmith - he doesn't like me, and a general shop clerk. The general store's connected to the bar, and it's always noisy and crowded in there.}{}{}{}{}
